<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Название книги</title>
    <style>
        /* ============================================
           БАЗОВЫЕ НАСТРОЙКИ И ШРИФТЫ
           ============================================ */
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 2.5cm 2cm 2.5cm 2cm;
            
            @top-center {
                content: string(chapter-title);
                font-size: 9pt;
                color: #666;
                border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #ccc;
                padding-bottom: 5pt;
            }
            
            @bottom-center {
                content: counter(page);
                font-size: 10pt;
            }
            
            @bottom-left {
                content: "© Автор";
                font-size: 8pt;
                color: #999;
            }
        }

        @page :first {
            @top-center { content: none; }
            @bottom-center { content: none; }
            @bottom-left { content: none; }
        }

        @page cover {
            margin: 0;
            @top-center { content: none; }
            @bottom-center { content: none; }
            @bottom-left { content: none; }
        }

        @page toc {
            @top-center { content: "Содержание"; }
        }

        @page chapter {
            @top-center {
                content: string(chapter-title);
            }
        }

        /* ============================================
           ОБЩИЕ СТИЛИ
           ============================================ */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #222;
            text-align: justify;
            hyphens: auto;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-family: "Georgia", serif;
            page-break-after: avoid;
            orphans: 3;
            widows: 3;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 0.8em;
            text-indent: 1.5em;
        }

        p:first-of-type {
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        /* ============================================
           ОБЛОЖКА
           ============================================ */
        .cover {
            page: cover;
            break-after: page;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 3cm;
        }

        .cover-title {
            font-size: 36pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .cover-subtitle {
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            margin-bottom: 2em;
        }

        .cover-author {
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-top: 3em;
            color: #ccc;
        }

        .cover-year {
            font-size: 12pt;
            margin-top: 1em;
            color: #999;
        }

        /* ============================================
           ТИТУЛЬНЫЙ ЛИСТ
           ============================================ */
        .title-page {
            break-after: page;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            min-height: 80vh;
            padding: 2cm;
        }

        .title-page h1 {
            font-size: 28pt;
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        .title-page .author {
            font-size: 16pt;
            margin-top: 2em;
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        .title-page .publisher {
            font-size: 12pt;
            margin-top: 4em;
            color: #666;
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        /* ============================================
           СОДЕРЖАНИЕ (ОГЛАВЛЕНИЕ)
           ============================================ */
        .toc {
            page: toc;
            break-after: page;
        }

        .toc h2 {
            font-size: 20pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5em;
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        .toc ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .toc li {
            margin-bottom: 0.6em;
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
        }

        .toc a {
            color: #222;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            align-items: baseline;
        }

        .toc a:hover {
            color: #0f3460;
        }

        .toc .toc-title {
            flex: 1;
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        .toc .toc-dots {
            flex: 1;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #999;
            margin: 0 0.3em;
            height: 0.8em;
        }

        .toc .toc-page {
            min-width: 2em;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .toc .toc-chapter {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 0.8em;
        }

        .toc .toc-section {
            padding-left: 1.5em;
        }

        /* ============================================
           ПРЕДИСЛОВИЕ / ВВЕДЕНИЕ
           ============================================ */
        .preface {
            break-after: page;
        }

        .preface h2 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5em;
            string-set: chapter-title "";
        }

        /* ============================================
           ГЛАВЫ И РАЗДЕЛЫ
           ============================================ */
        .chapter {
            page: chapter;
            break-before: page;
        }

        .chapter-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2em;
            padding-bottom: 1em;
            border-bottom: 2pt solid #0f3460;
        }

        .chapter-number {
            font-size: 14pt;
            color: #666;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
            display: block;
        }

        .chapter-title {
            font-size: 24pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a1a2e;
            string-set: chapter-title content();
            text-indent: 0;
        }

        .chapter h3 {
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-top: 1.5em;
            margin-bottom: 0.8em;
            color: #16213e;
        }

        .chapter h4 {
            font-size: 12pt;
            margin-top: 1.2em;
            margin-bottom: 0.6em;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* ============================================
           БЛОКИ ЦИТАТ, ПРИМЕЧАНИЯ
           ============================================ */
        blockquote {
            margin: 1.5em 2em;
            padding: 0.5em 1em;
            border-left: 3pt solid #0f3460;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #444;
            background: #f9f9f9;
        }

        blockquote p {
            text-indent: 0;
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
        }

        blockquote cite {
            display: block;
            text-align: right;
            font-style: normal;
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 0.5em;
        }

        /* ============================================
           ПРИМЕЧАНИЯ В ТЕКСТЕ (СНОСКИ)
           ============================================ */
        .footnote {
            font-size: 9pt;
            vertical-align: super;
            color: #0f3460;
        }

        .footnotes {
            margin-top: 2em;
            padding-top: 1em;
            border-top: 1pt solid #ccc;
            font-size: 9pt;
        }

        .footnotes ol {
            padding-left: 1.5em;
        }

        .footnotes li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
        }

        /* ============================================
           ТАБЛИЦЫ
           ============================================ */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 1.5em 0;
            font-size: 10pt;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 0.5em;
            border: 1pt solid #ccc;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        caption {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
            text-align: left;
        }

        /* ============================================
           РИСУНКИ
           ============================================ */
        figure {
            margin: 1.5em 0;
            text-align: center;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        figure img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        figcaption {
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 0.5em;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* ============================================
           ПРИЛОЖЕНИЯ
           ============================================ */
        .appendix {
            page: chapter;
            break-before: page;
        }

        .appendix .chapter-header {
            border-bottom-color: #666;
        }

        .appendix .chapter-number {
            color: #999;
        }

        /* ============================================
           БИБЛИОГРАФИЯ
           ============================================ */
        .bibliography {
            break-before: page;
        }

        .bibliography h2 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5em;
        }

        .bibliography ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .bibliography li {
            margin-bottom: 1em;
            padding-left: 2em;
            text-indent: -2em;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }

        /* ============================================
           УКАЗАТЕЛЬ
           ============================================ */
        .index {
            break-before: page;
            column-count: 2;
            column-gap: 2em;
        }

        .index h2 {
            column-span: all;
            font-size: 18pt;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5em;
        }

        .index ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .index li {
            margin-bottom: 0.3em;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }

        .index .index-page {
            float: right;
            color: #666;
        }

        /* ============================================
           ПЕЧАТЬ И РАЗРЫВЫ СТРАНИЦ
           ============================================ */
        .page-break {
            break-after: page;
        }

        .no-break {
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        /* Для печати */
        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
            }
            
            a {
                color: #222;
                text-decoration: none;
            }
            
            a[href]::after {
                content: " (" attr(href) ")";
                font-size: 8pt;
                color: #666;
            }
            
            /* Не показывать URL для внутренних якорей */
            a[href^="#"]::after {
                content: "";
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ============================================
         ОБЛОЖКА
         ============================================ -->
    <div class="cover">
        <div class="cover-title">Название Книги</div>
        <div class="cover-subtitle">Подзаголовок или краткое описание книги</div>
        <div class="cover-author">Имя Автора</div>
        <div class="cover-year">2026</div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================
         ТИТУЛЬНЫЙ ЛИСТ
         ============================================ -->
    <div class="title-page">
        <h1>Название Книги</h1>
        <p class="author">Имя Автора</p>
        <p class="publisher">Издательство<br>Город, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================
         СОДЕРЖАНИЕ
         ============================================ -->
    <nav class="toc">
        <h2>Содержание</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="toc-chapter">
                <a href="#preface">
                    <span class="toc-title">Предисловие</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">5</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="toc-chapter">
                <a href="#ch1">
                    <span class="toc-title">Глава 1. Название первой главы</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">7</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="toc-section">
                <a href="#ch1-1">
                    <span class="toc-title">1.1. Первый раздел</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">9</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="toc-section">
                <a href="#ch1-2">
                    <span class="toc-title">1.2. Второй раздел</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">15</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="toc-chapter">
                <a href="#ch2">
                    <span class="toc-title">Глава 2. Название второй главы</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">23</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="toc-section">
                <a href="#ch2-1">
                    <span class="toc-title">2.1. Первый раздел</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">25</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="toc-chapter">
                <a href="#appendix">
                    <span class="toc-title">Приложение А. Дополнительные материалы</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">45</span>
                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="toc-chapter">
                <a href="#bibliography">
                    <span class="toc-title">Библиография</span>
                    <span class="toc-dots"></span>
                    <span class="toc-page">50</span>
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- ============================================
         ПРЕДИСЛОВИЕ
         ============================================ -->
    <section class="preface" id="preface">
        <h2>Предисловие</h2>
        <p>Это предисловие к книге. Здесь автор может рассказать о целях написания книги, благодарить людей, описать структуру издания.</p>
        <p>Второй абзац предисловия. Текст выровнен по ширине с автоматическими переносами слов.</p>
        <blockquote>
            <p>«Цитата, которую автор считает важной для понимания книги.»</p>
            <cite>— Имя автора цитаты</cite>
        </blockquote>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================
         ГЛАВА 1
         ============================================ -->
    <article class="chapter" id="ch1">
